SUMMARY:Phil's Hills: Blossom Hill Repeats
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride Leader:** Phil New
 swanger\n\n**Phil’s Hills**: a series of structured hill repeat rides de
 signed to build strength\, endurance and boost your overall fitness.\n\n**
 Route link:** [Phil's Hills: Blossom Hill Repeats](https://ridewithgps.com
 /routes/50354000)\n**PDF link:** [Cuesheet](https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws
 .com/assets.modomadethis.com/cuesheets/Phils_Hills_Blossom_Hill_Repeats.pd
 f)\n\nWhat to Expect:\n\n* **Route:** Expect a total distance of approxima
 tely **15-20 miles**\, including **3-4 loops** of a circuit featuring **1-
 2 climbing segment**.\n* **Focus:** We'll emphasize maintaining a consiste
 nt climbing tempo\, active recovery between efforts\, and repeating the ef
 fort to build power and efficiency.\n* **Pace:** We'll maintain a comforta
 ble average pace range of **14-16 mph**.\n* **No-Drop Policy:** You'll nev
 er be left behind! We'll regroup after climbs to ensure everyone stays tog
 ether.\n\n\\-\\-\\-\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds or audible music-
 playing devices. Please bring water\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\,
  tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).
